      "objective": "Implement RFC 0143 Slice B CapabilityReseal on top of the landed RFC 0168 per-lane uid substrate. Keep authority narrow: never widen the daemon admin client-token, never expose a general public reseal bearer, bind reseal authority to the active lane uid lease id and generation, and preserve the Slice A typed floor. Recheck runtime schema and owner bundle frontiers before adding any migration or owner bundle; current source frontier is runtime schema 47 and owner bundle 0023. Add focused success and failure tests, update source-truth docs that move with the implementation, and publish DRAFT.md summarizing files changed, gate coverage, commands run, and residual operator work.",
