      "objective": "Apply accepted review findings and finalize the RFC 0143 Slice B CapabilityReseal implementation. The final state must keep the reseal authority scoped to session, job, and uid lease; fail closed on stale generation or lease mismatch; reject sibling-lane replay; preserve expired-beyond-grace and Slice A typed floors; keep route and capability documentation current; and include verification results. Publish SUMMARY.md enumerating changes, review findings addressed, commands run, and any remaining operator and deploy work.",
